  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, is."
  },
  "options": [
    {
