  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;is obtained by <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0114_ea96226a73fc.png\" style=\"width: 223px; height: 285px;\" /></p><p>So, area of the required region is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>"
